ring** (every 3 to 4 months) alongside **aggressive control of systemic risk factors** (HbA1c, blood pressure, lipid profile) to prevent progression to proliferative diabetic retinopathy (PDR) or macular edema. Active treatments like PRP or anti-VEGF are not indicated at this stage.'),
